<title>UK: Morgan Crucible yr profit up 15.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Morgan Crucible yr profit up 15.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to January 4, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 29.1		  vs  25.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   8.0		  vs   7.55</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  14.6		  vs  13.8</p>
<p> Pretax pre-excepts	98.0		  vs  85.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   897.5		  vs 847.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 98.2 and 102.0 million stg. Pretax profit including exceptional items was 100.2 million stg versus 85.0 million. Acquisitions contributed 32 million stg to this year's turnover. Earnings per share quoted are the undiluted figures. Underlying earnings per share were 28.7p against 25.4p.</p>
<p>Full company name - Morgan Crucible Co Plc.</p>
</text>
